Z||000000||Jasons85GT||08-27-2001||10:05 PM||||Hey all, whats up? Im new here and I just wanted to let you know I bought a Fiero a few days ago. An 85 GT. I love it! I knew the guy who owned it before me, and it was very well maintained! Runs excellent! Only thing is that the paint is faded. Anyone have a ballpark figure of what it might cost to get a Fiero painted? I was just curious! Thanks.||||reg||6
