Z||000003||skitime||08-27-2001||10:42 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by kempo:<BR><B>The local painting shop quoted me about $1500 for a new paint job, single color (don't need the ground fx painted), in black.  Kempo wants lots and lots of metalflake!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Jason 85 GT welcome. I had a bill around $1800 for mine with all the panels removed and painted.  Kempo you have to bring all those metal flakes up here to show us PA guys and gals. If you ever want to take a drive up again. <P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-1.JPG">  <p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 08-27-2001).]||||reg||1
