Z||000005||Carrolles||08-28-2001||08:00 AM||||Welcome to the forum.<P>I took my silver 85SE to Peach (franchise paint shop like Maaco) for an estimate.  They quoted me $660 US for a true base coat/clear coat job.  They will remove all trim but not the body panels.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Old Lar||08-28-2001||08:11 AM||||Good paint jobs are over $1500.  Skitime's $1800 panel off repaint is a real good price. I had been quoted twice that for a panel off repaint.<P>The low end Maacco prices look it.  They save money by not doing any prep and skimp on the masking tape.||||reg||1
