Z||000008||Spektrum-87GT||08-28-2001||12:14 PM||||i guess this is 2 new virginia members in a week, i just got my 87 gt last weekend. as far as paint, im in the same boat. I'm planning on doing it myself though. Theres a site around that explains in detail how to paint it(search for the fiero secrets web page, its under the paint catagory)... and it turned out really nice! total cost for me(including parts i have to get and the mini-paint booth i'm building) is going to be around 600. I'm also painting my other vehicle and dont have to my fiero on the road right away, so this might not be a good option for you.||||reg||1
